apply(add, 5)\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \fs22\f2 15 \sa60\cell \row \pard\plain\sl-1\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s2\sl413 {\*\bkmkstart ID_expr_45_if}{\*\bkmkend ID_expr_45_if}\b\fs31\f1 7.8 If Expressions\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 If expressions evaluate one of two branches based on a boolean condition. The syntax is \f2 if\f0  followed by the condition, a colon, the consequent, and optionally \f2 else\f0  with an alternative.\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl257 \fs19\lang1024\f2 if true: 1 else 0        ; evaluates to 1\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
if false: 1 else 0       ; evaluates to 0\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
if 5 > 3: 10 else 20     ; evaluates to 10\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl286 \fs22\lang1033\f0 If expressions can be nested:\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl257 \fs19\lang1024\f2 if false: 1 else if true: 2 else 3  ; evaluates to 2\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s2\sl413 {\*\bkmkstart ID_expr_45_match}{\*\bkmkend ID_expr_45_match}\b\fs31\f1 7.9 Match Expressions\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 A \f2 match\f0  expression \'97 comparing a value against multiple \f2 case\f0  alternatives \'97 is part of the grammar but not yet functional in the current compiler. Use \f2 if\f0 /\f2 else\f0  chains, or \f2 choose\f0  on a union, instead.\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s2\sl413 {\*\bkmkstart ID_category_45_CHOOSE_45_EXPRESSIONS}{\*\bkmkend ID_category_45_CHOOSE_45_EXPRESSIONS}\b\fs31\lang1024\f1 7.10 Choose Expressions\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 Choose expressions pattern match on union types, allowing different code paths based on which variant is present.\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s3\sl365 {\*\bkmkstart ID_tests_45_CHOOSE_45_ON_45_VARIANTS}{\*\bkmkend ID_tests_45_CHOOSE_45_ON_45_VARIANTS}\b\fs28\lang1024\f1 7.10.1 Choose on Variant Construction\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 Choose can match directly on constructed variants.\sa330\par\trowd\trql\trhdr \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Input\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Result\sa60\cell \row \trowd\trql \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl257 \fs19\f2 define Option union(Some: int, None)\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
