choose Option.None: when v: Some: v else 0\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \fs22\f2 0 \sa60\cell \row \pard\plain\sl-1\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s3\sl365 {\*\bkmkstart ID_tests_45_CHOOSE_45_BINDING}{\*\bkmkend ID_tests_45_CHOOSE_45_BINDING}\b\fs28\f1 7.10.2 Choose with Binding\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 When a variant carries a value, the value can be bound to a name.\sa330\par\trowd\trql\trhdr \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Input\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Result\sa60\cell \row \trowd\trql \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl257 \fs19\f2 define Result union(Ok: int, Err: int)\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
choose Result.Ok(42): when x: Ok: x + 1 else 0\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \fs22\f2 43 \sa60\cell \row \pard\plain\sl-1\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s3\sl365 {\*\bkmkstart ID_tests_45_CHOOSE_45_MULTIPLE_45_WHEN}{\*\bkmkend ID_tests_45_CHOOSE_45_MULTIPLE_45_WHEN}\b\fs28\f1 7.10.3 Multiple When Clauses\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 Choose can have multiple when clauses to match different variants.\sa330\par\trowd\trql\trhdr \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Input\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Result\sa60\cell \row \trowd\trql \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl257 \fs19\f2 define Result union(Ok: int, Err: int)\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
