choose Result.Err(5): when x: Ok: x when e: Err: e + 100\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \fs22\f2 105 \sa60\cell \row \pard\plain\sl-1\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s2\sl413 {\*\bkmkstart ID_category_45_OPTIONAL_45_TYPES}{\*\bkmkend ID_category_45_OPTIONAL_45_TYPES}\b\fs31\f1 7.11 Optional Types\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 Optional types use null pointer optimization (NPO) for efficient representation.\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s3\sl365 {\*\bkmkstart ID_tests_45_IS_45_NULL_45_CHECK}{\*\bkmkend ID_tests_45_IS_45_NULL_45_CHECK}\b\fs28\lang1024\f1 7.11.1 Is Null Check\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 The is null expression checks if an optional value is None.\sa330\par\trowd\trql\trhdr \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Input\sa60\cell \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl286 \b\fs22\f1 Result\sa60\cell \row \trowd\trql \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx4320\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\cellx8640 \plain \pard\intbl\sb60\li100\ri100\sl257 \fs19\f2 define Option[T] union: (Some: T, None)\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
